name asana-math
category Package
revision 59629
shortdesc A font to typeset maths in Xe(La)TeX and Lua(La)TeX
longdesc The Asana-Math font is an OpenType font that includes almost
longdesc all mathematical Unicode symbols and it can be used to typeset
longdesc mathematical text with any software that can understand the
longdesc MATH OpenType table (e.g., XeTeX 0.997 and Microsoft Word
longdesc 2007). The font is beta software. Typesetting support for use
longdesc with LaTeX is provided by the fontspec and unicode-math
longdesc packages.
